                        "form": "ола́дьях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "263f5102-71fa-3210-bae5-eca1abb0871b",
                        "entry_id": "699bf464-15f4-3964-9124-b3efa2882594",
                        "glosses": [
                            "кулин. небольшая толстая лепёшка из пшеничной муки"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ab0a45b-b836-489f-89cc-2a764d0b9afb",
                                "sense_id": "263f5102-71fa-3210-bae5-eca1abb0871b",
                                "text": "Субочевы обедали ровно в двенадцать часов и ели все старинные кушанья: сырники, пигусы, солянки, рассольники, саламаты, кокурки, кисели, взвары, верченую курятину с шафраном, оладьи с мёдом…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1427dd7b-c796-4045-9baf-b6605e666ea0",
                                "sense_id": "263f5102-71fa-3210-bae5-eca1abb0871b",
                                "text": "За павлинами следовали кулебяки, курники, пироги с мясом и с сыром, блины всех возможных родов, кривые пирожки и оладьи."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e9358db-e15a-4288-a44c-39fa658ff674",
                                "sense_id": "263f5102-71fa-3210-bae5-eca1abb0871b",
                                "text": "В воскресенье первой недели поста старуха пекла оладьи, а они всё подгорали у неё; красная от огня, она гневно кричала: — А, черти бы вас взяли… И вдруг, понюхав сковороду, потемнела, швырнула сковородник на пол и завыла: — Ба-атюшки, сковорода-то скоромная, поганая, не выжгла ведь я её в чистый-то понедельник, го-осподи!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b77fa76-91de-468d-a9f6-49fe7ffa2bbe",
                        "source_entry_id": "699bf464-15f4-3964-9124-b3efa2882594",
                        "source_sense_id": "263f5102-71fa-3210-bae5-eca1abb0871b",
                        "target_lang_word": "small",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "small",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5e13959-b23b-3ada-9ca0-08c33b93903b",
                                        "entry_id": "36e0647e-7bf3-33cf-bea3-de72542e7d9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not large or big; insignificant; few in number."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "563c3597-090e-4ecb-b8f2-4767d071057f",
                                                "sense_id": "c5e13959-b23b-3ada-9ca0-08c33b93903b",
                                                "text": "A small serving of ice cream."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4adb169-d41a-44c4-aa24-0301594aaea3",
                                                "sense_id": "c5e13959-b23b-3ada-9ca0-08c33b93903b",
                                                "text": "A small group."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a48d76f3-9651-4eae-9d40-a2ff2039a2fa",
                                                "sense_id": "c5e13959-b23b-3ada-9ca0-08c33b93903b",
                                                "text": "Here, in the transept and choir, where the service was being held, one was conscious every moment of an increasing brightness; colours glowing vividly beneath the circular chandeliers, and the rows of small lights on the choristers' desks flashed and sparkled in front of the boys' faces, deep linen collars, and red neckbands."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d910bba-f463-46ef-8417-ead08446871d",
                                                "sense_id": "c5e13959-b23b-3ada-9ca0-08c33b93903b",
                                                "text": "Private-equity nabobs bristle at being dubbed mere financiers. Piling debt onto companies’ balance-sheets is only a small part of what leveraged buy-outs are about, they insist. Improving the workings of the businesses they take over is just as core to their calling, if not more so. Much of their pleading is public-relations bluster."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24321215-7491-47cd-b74d-fa370f87a366",
                                                "sense_id": "c5e13959-b23b-3ada-9ca0-08c33b93903b",
                                                "text": "The orbiter has been observing the moon since 2009, and its reflector is a smaller version of reflector panels placed on the lunar surface during the Apollo 11, 14 and 15 landings on the moon. Soviet lunar robotic landers sent in 1970 and 1973 also carried smaller reflectors."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1506b99-4b3f-45dd-a5ba-661d9c6f267d",
                                                "sense_id": "c5e13959-b23b-3ada-9ca0-08c33b93903b",
                                                "text": "Guinness World Record confirmed the micro-cube as the world’s smallest rotating puzzle cube in August."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe32df00-cd92-39bb-ac9b-0f88d0d12b5f",
                                        "entry_id": "36e0647e-7bf3-33cf-bea3-de72542e7d9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not large or big; insignificant; few in number.",
                                            "Humiliated or insignificant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6e8d21c-405c-456a-8dc2-0fcd400dd48e",
                                                "sense_id": "fe32df00-cd92-39bb-ac9b-0f88d0d12b5f",
                                                "text": "The bullies had succeeded in making him feel small."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cabcd5c-b5ec-4fb3-bde8-7c79a3ac17f2",
                                                "sense_id": "fe32df00-cd92-39bb-ac9b-0f88d0d12b5f",
                                                "text": "For all the times that you made me feel small / I fell in love, now I feel nothing at all"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf577756-d612-3e54-9976-8c8297b58a96",
                                        "entry_id": "36e0647e-7bf3-33cf-bea3-de72542e7d9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not large or big; insignificant; few in number.",
                                            "Having a small penis, muscles, or other important body parts, regardless of overall body size."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22b3b430-a7ac-4ed8-a396-42d87a7a3d7e",
                                                "sense_id": "bf577756-d612-3e54-9976-8c8297b58a96",
                                                "text": "(of genitals)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79547717-1d50-441f-9058-bf2f2dd52873",
                                                "sense_id": "bf577756-d612-3e54-9976-8c8297b58a96",
                                                "text": "Though over six feet tall, the man was very small and ashamed to undress."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ecd2606-247f-3381-8e84-1dd9488a9d81",
                                        "entry_id": "36e0647e-7bf3-33cf-bea3-de72542e7d9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Young, as a child."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0dcb5b4-263a-4710-b83f-31566b2c49f1",
                                                "sense_id": "4ecd2606-247f-3381-8e84-1dd9488a9d81",
                                                "text": "Remember when the children were small?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61b1e558-afd7-3e59-969b-59614a33030c",
                                        "entry_id": "36e0647e-7bf3-33cf-bea3-de72542e7d9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Minuscule or lowercase, referring to written or printed letters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e76307b9-9cf7-460d-9d12-6b3afcaf46c5",
                                                "sense_id": "61b1e558-afd7-3e59-969b-59614a33030c",
                                                "text": "\"I've got catholic tastes. Catholic with a small \"c\", of course.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a850ef79-947a-3af5-9a38-fc4b4dada756",
                                        "entry_id": "36e0647e-7bf3-33cf-bea3-de72542e7d9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Evincing little worth or ability; not large-minded; paltry; mean."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd1399bd-209d-48c9-8cb0-cbb8f32f6807",
                                                "sense_id": "a850ef79-947a-3af5-9a38-fc4b4dada756",
                                                "text": "A true delineation of the smallest man is capable of interesting the greatest man."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e19d3bff-8df6-30da-9004-804a76194fcc",
                                        "entry_id": "36e0647e-7bf3-33cf-bea3-de72542e7d9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not prolonged in duration; not extended in time; short."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "720d6f58-0cd7-42cb-ac9e-7956f9369bd0",
                                                "sense_id": "e19d3bff-8df6-30da-9004-804a76194fcc",
                                                "text": "a small space of time"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f0dfb31-8f18-3a70-929b-b8a2aafd666c",
                                        "entry_id": "36e0647e-7bf3-33cf-bea3-de72542e7d9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of little (“of an industry or institution(s) therein: operating on a small scale, unlike larger counterparts”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
